                        <provenance type="#e"><orgName role="fmo" key="org_841">Exeter, Devon.
                                Parish church of St Mary Major</orgName>
                            <p><q>Istud manuale constat <persName key="person_3965">Roberto
                                        Lyngham</persName>. Quod quidem Manuale, una cum novo
                                    Missale quod incipit in secundo folio post kalendare <q>Omnes
                                        albi cum amictibus</q> ad divina dicendum in eisdem ac unum
                                    superpellicium magnistri <persName>Elias Stoke</persName>, et
                                    R[...] Mark, ac dominus <persName>Symon Chydlegh</persName>,
                                    executores dicti domini Roberti, dederunt et concesserunt
                                    parochialis ecclesie Beate Marie Majoris Exoniensis, remansurum
                                    in dicta ecclesia in perpetuum, ea videlicet condicione ...</q>
                                on verso of last leaf. Robert Lingham was rector of St Mary Major in
                                1427. See <bibl>George Oliver, <title>Lives of the Bishops of
                                        Exeter</title> (Exeter, 1861), p.
                            266.</bibl></p></provenance>
                    </history>
